{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國知名節目主持Ryan Seacrest身邊經常有索女出現，最近他就與來自荷蘭的索模Maxime Nova蜜運中。</p><p>據知Ryan與Maxime玩認真，有知情者爆料表示：「他完全被她迷住了，而她對他也有同樣的feeling——他們正深深地墮入愛河。」擁有一頭金髮的「荷蘭姑娘」Maxime身材出眾是「9頭身美女」。她曾與美國超模姊妹花Gigi與Bella Hadid的富商父親Mohamed Hadid拍過拖，不過後來分手。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:20:58.321740+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:01:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.264235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:17:43.780568+00:00","content_hash":"a8f0b309c07e01d1eb201ff9d80c650fc4ebe360bb3a89a910f76a6aff31e5ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:20:58.321740+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}